     "titulo": "From… onwards",
     "texto": [
      "**从……起** marks the point from which something starts: **从今天起** = from today onwards. It can refer to a place or a time.",
      "**外地** means «another area» or «outside one's own city or region»; it doesn't always mean another country. **外语** does mean «foreign language»."
